## Defaults for site settings left empty (docs/architecture.md, "Languages").

# The name of the site's points when "Points name" is left empty.
brand-credit-name = Points
# The name of the weekly activity figure in the sidebar statistics when its setting is left empty.
brand-index-name = Activity Index
# The site description (meta description, feeds) when it is left empty.
brand-site-description = A community forum.
# A level's name when the level names are left empty; $n starts at 1.
brand-level-name = Level { $n }
# The notice while the forum is read-only, when the site leaves it empty.
brand-read-only-message = The forum is read-only for now. Please try again later.
